      "source_hash": 4870562717423977864,
      "context_hash": 6179341316658492834,
      "translation": "Performance Ninja 강좌",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "[![YouTube](https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCGmEJdQ993cdCGdnLZDuOOQ)](https://youtube.com/@easyperf3992) [![X (formerly Twitter) Follow](https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/dendibakh)](https://twitter.com/dendibakh) ![GitHub Repo stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dendibakh/perf-ninja)",
      "source_hash": 2514394237805380505,
      "context_hash": 13286799332455721904,
      "translation": "[![YouTube](https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCGmEJdQ993cdCGdnLZDuOOQ)](https://youtube.com/@easyperf3992) [![X (formerly Twitter) Follow](https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/dendibakh)](https://twitter.com/dendibakh) ![GitHub Repo stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dendibakh/perf-ninja)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Github": "Github"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This is an online course where you can learn to find and fix low-level performance issues, for example CPU cache misses and branch mispredictions.",
      "source_hash": 6629288014070467667,
      "context_hash": 7972906710282591431,
      "translation": "이 강좌는 CPU 캐시 미스나 분기 예측 실패와 같은 저수준 성능 문제를 찾아 해결하는 방법을 배울 수 있는 온라인 강좌입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "cache": "캐시",
        "mispredictions": "예측 실패"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "It's all about practice.",
      "source_hash": 9959605494274046765,
      "context_hash": 14437262711384469979,
      "translation": "핵심은 오로지 실습입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "So we offer you this course in a form of lab assignments and youtube videos.",
      "source_hash": 10002858410830304755,
      "context_hash": 8174268780216790989,
      "translation": "그래서 이 강좌는 실습 과제와 YouTube 동영상 형태로 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "assignments": "과제",
        "lab": "실습"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122271Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "You will spend at least 90% of the time analyzing performance of the code and trying to improve it.",
      "source_hash": 2360498235760377098,
      "context_hash": 10446889502117638008,
      "translation": "전체 시간 중 최소 90%는 코드의 성능을 분석하고 개선하는 데 쓰게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "code": "코드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[<img src=\"img/WelcomeVideo.png\">](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2tzdkC6IDbo&list=PLRWO2AL1QAV6bJAU2kgB4xfodGID43Y5d)",
      "source_hash": 7411474276017579515,
      "context_hash": 608418185411216784,
      "translation": "[<img src=\"img/WelcomeVideo.png\">](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2tzdkC6IDbo&list=PLRWO2AL1QAV6bJAU2kgB4xfodGID43Y5d)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Each lab assignment focuses on a specific performance problem and can take anywhere from 30 mins up to 4 hours depending on your background and the complexity of the lab assignment itself.",
      "source_hash": 6369291978688517996,
      "context_hash": 16191101593414378879,
      "translation": "각 실습 과제는 특정한 성능 문제 하나에 초점을 맞추며, 여러분의 배경 지식과 실습 과제 자체의 난이도에 따라 30분에서 4시간까지 걸릴 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "lab assignment": "실습 과제"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Once you're done improving the code, you can submit your solution to Github for automated benchmarking and verification.",
      "source_hash": 12844342345396264570,
      "context_hash": 6401606041478716010,
      "translation": "코드 개선을 마쳤다면 자동 벤치마킹과 검증을 위해 해답을 Github에 제출할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Github": "Github",
        "code": "코드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Performance Ninja is supported on Linux, Windows, and Mac, and is run on all the recent HW including Intel's 12th-gen Alderlake, AMD's Zen3, and Apple's M1 CPUs.",
      "source_hash": 13219474221076020642,
      "context_hash": 13621125743144653875,
      "translation": "Performance Ninja는 Linux, Windows, Mac을 지원하며, Intel 12세대 Alderlake, AMD Zen3, Apple M1 CPU를 비롯한 모든 최신 하드웨어에서 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Intel": "Intel",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "Windows": "Windows"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "You can observe the effect of your optimizations on a variety of modern platforms.",
      "source_hash": 4467772023019301861,
      "context_hash": 4318744958875223564,
      "translation": "다양한 최신 플랫폼에서 최적화의 효과를 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "optimizations": "최적화",
        "platforms": "플랫폼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Prerequisites: basic C++ skills are an absolute must-have for the course.",
      "source_hash": 17500888141376835669,
      "context_hash": 486577352761816383,
      "translation": "사전 요구 사항: 이 강좌를 수강하려면 기본적인 C++ 실력이 반드시 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Denis' [book](https://products.easyperf.net/perf-book-2) \"Performance Analysis and Tuning on Modern CPUs\" is recommended as an introduction to performance analysis basics.",
      "source_hash": 18222250563871505871,
      "context_hash": 13490568626085441995,
      "translation": "성능 분석의 기초를 익히는 입문서로 Denis의 [책](https://products.easyperf.net/perf-book-2) \"Performance Analysis and Tuning on Modern CPUs\"를 추천합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "performance analysis": "성능 분석"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:2",
      "source": "Knowledge of compilers, computer architecture, and the ability to read assembly code is a plus.",
      "source_hash": 10936506652218529571,
      "context_hash": 4493413478589671656,
      "translation": "컴파일러와 컴퓨터 아키텍처에 대한 지식, 그리고 어셈블리 코드를 읽는 능력이 있으면 도움이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "assembly code": "어셈블리 코드",
        "compilers": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Before you start working on lab assignments, make sure you read [Get Started page](GetStarted.md) and watch the [warmup video](https://youtu.be/jFRwAcIoLgQ).",
      "source_hash": 602931177882724223,
      "context_hash": 564710251521626018,
      "translation": "실습 과제를 시작하기 전에 반드시 [시작하기 페이지](GetStarted.md)를 읽고 [준비 운동 동영상](https://youtu.be/jFRwAcIoLgQ)을 시청하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "assignments": "과제",
        "lab": "실습"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122272Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Lab assignments in this project are implemented in C++.",
      "source_hash": 10528438018560062206,
      "context_hash": 1225641482341764838,
      "translation": "이 프로젝트의 실습 과제는 C++로 구현되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "assignments": "과제",
        "lab": "실습",
        "project": "프로젝트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122273Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Also, Performance Ninja was ported to:",
      "source_hash": 6255529782033180974,
      "context_hash": 6481729874654042202,
      "translation": "또한 Performance Ninja는 다음 언어로도 포팅되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122273Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust ([perf-ninja-rs](https://github.com/grahamking/perf-ninja-rs)), thanks to @grahamking.",
      "source_hash": 16602247444791274721,
      "context_hash": 17817896162169981672,
      "translation": "Rust([perf-ninja-rs](https://github.com/grahamking/perf-ninja-rs)), @grahamking 님께 감사드립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:19.122273Z",
